@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

state "Registration" as Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : do / Validate the Details
Registration : exit / Valid or Invalid Registration

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / Get the Login Details
Login : do / Validate the Login Details
Login : exit / Valid or Invalid Login

state "Citizen Home" as CitizenHome
CitizenHome : entry / Logged In Citizen
CitizenHome : do / Display Citizen Dashboard
CitizenHome : exit / Upload Documents
CitizenHome : exit / View Profile
CitizenHome : exit / Apply for Certificate
CitizenHome : exit / Logout

state "Upload Documents" as UploadDocuments
UploadDocuments : entry / To Upload Documents
UploadDocuments : do / Upload Document
UploadDocuments : exit / Continue Uploading or Finish

state "View Profile" as ViewProfile
ViewProfile : entry / To View Profile
ViewProfile : do / Display Citizen Profile
ViewProfile : exit / Return to Home

state "Apply for Certificate" as ApplyForCertificate
ApplyForCertificate : entry / To Apply for Certificate
ApplyForCertificate : do / Request Certificate
ApplyForCertificate : exit / Reapply or Finish

state "Reapply" as Reapply
Reapply : entry / To Reapply
Reapply : do / Send New Request to Issuer
Reapply : exit / Continue Applying or Finish

state "Registrar Home" as RegistrarHome
RegistrarHome : entry / Logged In Registrar
RegistrarHome : do / Display Registrar Dashboard
RegistrarHome : exit / Request Certificate
RegistrarHome : exit / Logout

state "Request Certificate" as RequestCertificate
RequestCertificate : entry / To Request Certificate
RequestCertificate : do / Send Request to Issuer
RequestCertificate : exit / Continue Requesting or Finish

state "End Session" as EndSession
EndSession : entry / User Done with Actions
EndSession : do / Log Out User
EndSession : exit / Session Ended

[*] --> Registration
Registration --> Login : [Valid Registration]

Login --> CitizenHome : [Valid Login]
CitizenHome --> UploadDocuments : [Upload Documents]
UploadDocuments --> CitizenHome : [Continue Uploading or Finish]
UploadDocuments --> ViewProfile : [View Profile]
UploadDocuments --> ApplyForCertificate : [Apply for Certificate]

ApplyForCertificate --> Reapply : [Reapply]
Reapply --> ApplyForCertificate : [Continue Applying or Finish]
ApplyForCertificate --> EndSession : [Finish]

CitizenHome --> ApplyForCertificate : [Apply for Certificate]
ApplyForCertificate --> Reapply : [Reapply]
ApplyForCertificate --> EndSession : [Finish]

Login --> RegistrarHome : [Valid Login as Registrar]
RegistrarHome --> RequestCertificate : [Request Certificate]
RequestCertificate --> RegistrarHome : [Continue Requesting or Finish]
RequestCertificate --> EndSession : [Finish]

EndSession --> [*] : [Session Ended]

UploadDocuments --> CitizenHome : [Continue Uploading or Finish]
ApplyForCertificate --> Reapply : [Reapply]
ApplyForCertificate --> EndSession : [Finish]
RequestCertificate --> RegistrarHome : [Continue Requesting or Finish]
RequestCertificate --> EndSession : [Finish]

@enduml
